## CI/CD 파이프라인

### GitHub Actions (예시)

```yaml
name: Deploy to Production

on:
  push:
    branches: [main]

jobs:
  deploy:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v2

      - name: Build
        run: [build-command]

      - name: Test
        run: [test-command]

      - name: Deploy
        run: [deploy-command]
```

### GitLab CI (예시)

```yaml
stages:
  - build
  - test
  - deploy

deploy_production:
  stage: deploy
  script:
    - [deploy-script]
  only:
    - main
```

