## 스케일링

### 수평 스케일링

```bash
# Kubernetes 스케일링
kubectl scale deployment/{{PROJECT_NAME}} --replicas=[N] -n {{PROJECT_NAME}}
```

### 수직 스케일링

- 리소스 제한 조정
- 인스턴스 타입 변경

### 오토스케일링

```yaml
# Horizontal Pod Autoscaler
apiVersion: autoscaling/v2
kind: HorizontalPodAutoscaler
metadata:
  name: {{PROJECT_NAME}}-hpa
spec:
  scaleTargetRef:
    apiVersion: apps/v1
    kind: Deployment
    name: {{PROJECT_NAME}}
  minReplicas: 2
  maxReplicas: 10
  metrics:
  - type: Resource
    resource:
      name: cpu
      target:
        type: Utilization
        averageUtilization: 70
```

